        </?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G1>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #P3-T1 { name = "Verify lifecycle multi-stage retry and fresh recovery journey" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P3-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G2>
              A real lifecycle journey covers same-stage turns, stage transitions, tool selection, retry and fresh recovery with every miss mapped to an epoch reason.
              </?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G2>
              <Criterion #P3-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G3>
              The complete journey satisfies ratified final-wire, tool/control and normalized-cost ceilings.
              </?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G3>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task #P3-T2 { name = "Verify ordinary and AI Ctrl/Data node zero lifecycle overhead" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 1 } (
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P3-T2-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G4>
              Ordinary, Ctrl and Data product journeys have no lifecycle facet, managed Skill or stage/progress fact; their serialized schema intersection with lifecycle-internal tools is empty and public gateways are separately attributed.
              </?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G4>
              <Criterion #P3-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G5>
              Their same-epoch prefix and normalized-cost gates remain within the G1 ratified bounds.
              </?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G5>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task #P3-T3 { name = "Record official DeepSeek evidence or explicit G5 handoff" status = "DONE" priority = "P1" order = 2 } (
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P3-T3-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G6>
              When official credentials exist, three warmed `deepseek-official-chat@1` groups satisfy per-group hit `>=0.85`, p50 `>=0.90`, cost p50 `<=248`, p95 and every group `<=260`; compatible evidence cannot satisfy this criterion.
              </?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G6>
              <Criterion #P3-T3-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G7>
              Absent credentials produce `SKIPPED/UNKNOWN`; an executed request with missing, malformed, failed-attempt or non-final usage produces `UNKNOWN`; neither marks the live gate passed, and the unsatisfied evidence is handed to Mission G5.
              </?01M0X8GKP1QXYG7ADZGHRZD6G7>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Hooks [
